// External Slave driving 4'b1101 (0xD) onto Pin 0 (SDA) during RX turnaround window
002D_0001 // Cycle 45 (0x002D): Drive SDA = 1 (Bit 3)
0037_0001 // Cycle 55 (0x0037): Drive SDA = 1 (Bit 2)
0041_0000 // Cycle 65 (0x0041): Drive SDA = 0 (Bit 1)
004B_0001 // Cycle 75 (0x004B): Drive SDA = 1 (Bit 0)